title: "TAD"
version: "1.0.1"
type: software
license: "GPL-3.0"
abstract: "TAD (They All Die) is a Python package for handling and analyzing neural recordings, with a focus on spike rasters, burst detection, synchrony, avalanches, and event-triggered analyses."
